          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-[#d8c39e]"></span>
          <span>[ 05 // ULASAN PENGUNJUNG ]</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>GOOGLE MAPS 4.9 ★ VERIFIED</span>
        </div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white uppercase leading-none font-sans">
          Kata Mereka
